{"id": "7236aa58-7760-4397-a907-547cb2e9988d", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T14:18:16.726717", "source": "user", "parent_id": "2e8ad711-7e5e-43f8-ba36-ff9bba592c4d", "llm_message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "{"researcher_request": "नमस्ते। कृपया पहले रिपॉजिटरी और उपलब्ध फाइलों का निरीक्षण करें। इसके बाद यह परखने के लिए एक प्रस्तावित दृष्टिकोण (proposed approach) बताएं कि क्या MDGEN मॉडल सब-सैंपल्ड मॉलिक्यूलर डायनामिक्स (MD) ट्रैजेक्टरी से गायब फास्ट टाइमस्टेप डायनामिक्स (जैसे टॉर्शन एंगल ऑसिलेशन) को सटीक रूप से रिकवर कर पाता है। साथ ही अपनी मुख्य धारणाएं (assumptions) और अनिश्चितताएं (uncertainties) भी स्पष्ट करें। अभी पूरा एक्सपेरिमेंट डिज़ाइन प्रस्तुत न करें।", "required_handoff_stage": "plan", "approach_approved": false, "public_task": {"question": "Does the MDGEN model accurately recover the fast timestep dynamics (e.g., oscillations in torsion angles) that are missing in subsampled molecular dynamics trajectories?", "context": "Design an experiment that answers the question. The researcher can clarify source-supported setup details by topic. Do not claim that an experiment was run.", "environment": {"runtime": "bubblewrap", "network": "disabled", "repository": "/workspace", "python": "python3", "software_environment": "system Python; project dependencies not preinstalled", "datasets": [], "gpu_enabled": false, "cpu_affinity_count": 24, "note": "Successful exploratory commands are not proof of a completed experiment."}, "researcher_topics": [], "question_budget": 6, "actor_step_budget": 60, "continue_after_initial_plan": false}}"}], "tool_calls": null, "tool_call_id": null, "name": null}, "llm_response_id": null, "activated_skills": [], "extended_content": [], "sender": null, "kind": "MessageEvent", "source_event_index": 1}
